Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 21:03:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] local: changelog and update note from the local patch series

The help window said an update was available and its changelog stayed
empty. The update check asked The Lounge's GitHub releases - another
project - and announced its versions, which must not be installed over
this client; and no server handler answered the browser's "changelog"
request, so the changelog never loaded. The changelog is now the list of
local patches in this checkout (the "local:" commits on top of NexusIRC,
oldest first, with their first paragraph), nothing is fetched from the
network, no update is announced, and the version note says updates are
deployed together with erssi.
